# FlowTera Backend — Root .env.example
#
# Each service has its own .env file. Copy and fill the relevant one:
#
#   node-core-service/.env.example  →  node-core-service/.env
#   api-gateway/.env.example        →  api-gateway/.env
#   python-ml-service/.env.example  →  python-ml-service/.env
#
# Quick start:
#   cp node-core-service/.env.example  node-core-service/.env
#   cp api-gateway/.env.example        api-gateway/.env
#   cp python-ml-service/.env.example  python-ml-service/.env
#
# Then fill in the values in each .env file before running the services.
#
# ⚠️  Never commit .env files — they are excluded by .gitignore.
